/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
224 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (AS YOU NEAR THE END OF YOUR JOURNEY, CHAPTER 8, "BEYOND ARDUINO," EXPLORES OPPORTUNITIES FOR INTEGRATING ARDUINO WITH OTHER DEVICES AND PLATFORMS, OPENING DOORS TO ENDLESS POSSIBILITIES FOR INNOVATION AND COLLABORATION.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
225 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
