/T (ARDUINO IS AN OPEN-SOURCE ELECTRONICS PLATFORM BASED ON EASY-TO-USE HARDWARE AND SOFTWARE. IT CONSISTS OF A PROGRAMMABLE CIRCUIT BOARD, OFTEN REFERRED TO AS A MICROCONTROLLER, ALONG WITH AN INTEGRATED DEVELOPMENT ENVIRONMENT \(IDE\) USED FOR WRITING AND UPLOADING CODE TO THE BOARD. ARDUINO BOARDS ARE WIDELY USED IN VARIOUS PROJECTS, FROM SIMPLE DIY EXPERIMENTS TO COMPLEX ROBOTICS AND IOT APPLICATIONS.)
/E (ARDUINO IS AN OPEN-SOURCE ELECTRONICS PLATFORM BASED ON EASY-TO-USE HARDWARE AND SOFTWARE. IT CONSISTS OF A PROGRAMMABLE CIRCUIT BOARD, OFTEN REFERRED TO AS A MICROCONTROLLER, ALONG WITH AN INTEGRATED DEVELOPMENT ENVIRONMENT \(IDE\) USED FOR WRITING AND UPLOADING CODE TO THE BOARD. ARDUINO BOARDS ARE WIDELY USED IN VARIOUS PROJECTS, FROM SIMPLE DIY EXPERIMENTS TO COMPLEX ROBOTICS AND IOT APPLICATIONS.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
