/ActualText (CONTROL STRUCTURES ALLOW YOU TO CONTROL THE FLOW OF YOUR PROGRAM BASED ON CERTAIN CONDITIONS OR TO REPEAT A SET OF INSTRUCTIONS MULTIPLE TIMES. THE IF STATEMENT EVALUATES A CONDITION AND EXECUTES A BLOCK OF CODE IF THE CONDITION IS TRUE. THE ELSE STATEMENT CAN BE USED TO EXECUTE A DIFFERENT BLOCK OF CODE IF THE CONDITION IS FALSE.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
