/ActualText (IN THIS CHAPTER, WE'LL DELVE INTO ADVANCED INPUT/OUTPUT \(I/O\) TECHNIQUES THAT ALLOW FOR PRECISE CONTROL AND OPTIMIZATION IN ARDUINO PROJECTS. THESE TECHNIQUES INCLUDE INTERRUPTS, TIMERS, AND PULSE WIDTH MODULATION \(PWM\), WHICH ARE ESSENTIAL FOR BUILDING RESPONSIVE AND EFFICIENT SYSTEMS.)
