/ActualText (IN THIS CHAPTER, WE'LL FOCUS ON OPTIMIZING ARDUINO CODE FOR BETTER PERFORMANCE AND MEMORY USAGE, AS WELL AS TROUBLESHOOTING COMMON ISSUES THAT MAY ARISE DURING DEVELOPMENT. BY MASTERING OPTIMIZATION TECHNIQUES AND TROUBLESHOOTING STRATEGIES, YOU'LL BE ABLE TO CREATE MORE EFFICIENT AND ROBUST ARDUINO PROJECTS.)
