/Pg 31 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
433 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (C. EFFICIENT POWER SOURCES: CHOOSE EFFICIENT POWER SOURCES \(E.G., SWITCHING REGULATORS INSTEAD OF LINEAR REGULATORS\) TO MINIMIZE POWER LOSS AND EXTEND BATTERY LIFE IN BATTERY-POWERED PROJECTS.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
